InteractionGym patch for vLLM-Omni main at 61cae20d (source checkout)
Base: vllm-project/vllm-omni main, commit 61cae20d0f5c2b438564a892e250e08e72e5afa2 (2026-10-09; needs vllm==0.31.0)
Applies with: patch -p1 (from the root of that checkout). Use scripts/apply_vllm_omni_patch.py in the InteractionGym repo; see
patches/vllm-omni/README.md for the contents, the upstream PR of each part, and when to remove it.
Parts (in order): 01 input-clocked duplex sessions + silence_continuation (vllm-project/vllm-omni#8485),
02 per-unit token trace, 03 MiniCPM-o 4.5 input clock, 04 Qwen3-Omni input clock and hooks for Nemotron
VoiceChat / PersonaPlex / AURA (follow-ups of #8485, not yet opened), 05 MiniCPM-o per-session audio feature
extractor (vllm-project/vllm-omni#8638), 06 MiniCPM-o text-only sessions end at Stage 0 + the
minicpmo_4_5_thinker pipeline (InteractionGym only, not proposed upstream).
Package files plus the upstream unit tests and docs of every part.

