+"""Input-clocked sessions on the other duplex models (fake stage outputs, real plugins).
+
+MiniCPM-o 4.5 has its own module; these cover the frame-clocked models
+(Nemotron VoiceChat, PersonaPlex) through the real session runner and the
+input clock, and the commit-based ones (AURA, Qwen3-Omni) through the input
+clock with their real hooks. Every model is also checked across a cancel: the
+plugin's per-epoch ``state`` starts over and frames are counted against the
+unit's ordinal in its epoch, not its session-wide index.
+"""
+
